{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52649","headline":"□和 · □同","name":"□和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（上缺）影□□□□□□□□□□丹。\n□轼□黄土，□琴□武城。\n醴泉飞汉曲，芳桂□山□。\n□丹□彾□，羣英□雁声。\n□□□□德，{蠜虫=糸}□遂留情。\n□□□靡□，□□□□□。\n□□香可□，□□□□□。\n（同前）（按：此诗题仅存「和」字，知爲和前诗之作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"□同","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}